/************************************************************************
 *                                                                      *
 *        File: KnownHosts.c                                            *
 *                                                                      *
 *     Purpose: SSH-style known-hosts store (data model only; the       *
 *              manager window and the connect-time capture/dialogs are  *
 *              separate).  Stores a SHA-256 fingerprint of each         *
 *              server's identity and detects when it changes.          *
 *                                                                      *
 *              Storage is a flat text file, one tab-separated record    *
 *              per line, at <Choices$Write>.RDPClient.KnownHosts.  It   *
 *              is deliberately NOT encrypted: on single-user RISC OS    *
 *              there is nowhere to hide a key from someone who already  *
 *              has the user's file access, so encryption would be       *
 *              obfuscation, not protection.  The value of the store is  *
 *              change-detection (possible MITM / re-installed server),  *
 *              not secrecy.                                             *
